@CurrencyToWords.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5085

### The API is running if this returns the OpenAPI document
GET {{CurrencyToWords.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### English
POST {{CurrencyToWords.Api_HostAddress}}/api/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "999 999 999,99", "language": "en" }

### German
POST {{CurrencyToWords.Api_HostAddress}}/api/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "25,1", "language": "de" }

### Invalid amount: 400 with a German message
POST {{CurrencyToWords.Api_HostAddress}}/api/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "25,999", "language": "de" }

### Unsupported language: 400
POST {{CurrencyToWords.Api_HostAddress}}/api/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "1", "language": "fr" }
